@startuml
title M2 — Smart Risk Assessment and Safety Resource Recommendation\nActivity Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF3FA
  BorderColor #0B6FB8
  FontColor #19324D
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF4D6
  DiamondBorderColor #D78B00
  StartColor #19324D
  EndColor #19324D
  BarColor #E5B323
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E8
  BorderColor #F2A93B
  FontColor #5B4211
}

|#EAF3FA|Event Organiser / M1|
start
:Submit or resubmit event application;
:Create immutable EventVersion\nand set event status to Pending;

|#EEEAFB|M2 Assessment Service|
:Receive Firestore create/update trigger\nor authorised manual recompute;
:Load event and current version;

if (Pending event and\ncurrent version exists?) then (No)
  :Skip ineligible event\nor report missing version;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Build processing hash from input\nand active schema versions;
endif

|#E8F6F1|External Services & Data|
:Transactionally claim assessment job\nstatus = processing, with lease and claim ID;

if (Claim acquired?) then (No)
  :Return skipped\nalready ready, active, or stale;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#EEEAFB|M2 Assessment Service|
fork
|#E8F6F1|External Services & Data|
  :Fetch OpenWeather forecast\nor explicit fallback status;
fork again
  :Resolve Malaysia date, weekday,\nweekend and public holiday;
fork again
  :Match venue, verified capacity,\nfire and access context;
fork again
  :Retrieve comparable verified incidents\nby stable venue ID;
end fork

|#EEEAFB|M2 Assessment Service|
:Assemble versioned context snapshot\nwith source, timestamp and confidence;
:Apply active eight-domain category schema;
:Calculate HIRARC likelihood × severity\nfor every applicable hazard;
:Apply mitigation credit only\nfor verified controls;
:Calculate residual matrix and official risk;
note right
  Official risk = highest residual hazard.
  Deterministic result is immutable.
end note
:Calculate readiness, compliance\nand evidence confidence separately;

|#E8F6F1|External Services & Data|
:Send allowlisted non-PII event data,\ncontext and official result to MiniMax M3;
if (Response is available\nand schema-valid?) then (Yes)
  :Return advisory category explanation,\nconcerns and resource considerations;
else (No)
  :Return unavailable / invalid fallback;
  note right
    AI failure cannot change the official risk
    or deterministic resource formula.
  end note
endif

|#EEEAFB|M2 Assessment Service|
:Calculate deterministic resource baseline,\nplanning ranges and guideline rationale;
:Consolidate official assessment,\nAI advisory status and resources;

|#E8F6F1|External Services & Data|
:Begin final transaction and verify\nclaim ID, event status and version;
if (Claim and version\nstill current?) then (No)
  :Discard stale result safely;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Store versioned assessment\nand resource recommendation;
  :Update current assessment/resource IDs;
  :Write risk and resource audit entries;
endif

|#EEEAFB|M2 Assessment Service|
:Mark M2 output ready;
:Publish organiser-safe view to M1,\nfull review data to M3,\nand read-only fields to M5;
note right
  Handoff only: M3 owns the human decision.
  M3 may override resources with rationale,
  but cannot alter the official M2 result.
end note
stop

legend bottom
  |= Colour |= Responsibility |
  |<#EAF3FA> | Event Organiser / M1 |
  |<#EEEAFB> | M2 Assessment Service |
  |<#E8F6F1> | External context, AI and persistence |
endlegend
@enduml
